190. Reverse Bits

Reverse bits of a given 32 bits signed integer.

Example 1:

Input: n = 43261596

Output: 964176192

Explanation:

class Solution {
    public int reverseBits(int n) {
      StringBuilder result=new StringBuilder();
      int count=0;
      while(count<32){
        int num=n&1;
        result.append(num);
        count++;
        n=n>>1;
      }
       return Integer.parseInt(result.toString(),2);
    }
}
